    "text": "The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> curve for a ferromagnet is shown in the figure. The ferromagnet is placed inside a long solenoid with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1000</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>turns</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The current that should be passed in the solenoid to demagnetise the ferromagnet completely is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/juka.JPG\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 227px;\" />",
